    "text": "<p>An oxidation-reduction reaction in which 3 electrons are transferred has a <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msup><mi>&#916;G</mi><mn>0</mn></msup></math> of <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>17</mn><mo>.</mo><mn>37</mn><mo>&#160;</mo><mi>kJ</mi><mo>&#160;</mo><msup><mi>mol</mi><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msup></math> at <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>25</mn><mo>&#176;</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">C</mi><mo>.</mo></math> The value of <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msubsup><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">E</mi><mi>cell</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">o</mi></msubsup></math>&nbsp;(in V) is&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>_</mo><mo>_</mo><mo>_</mo><mo>_</mo><mo>_</mo><mo>_</mo><mo>_</mo><mo>&#215;</mo><msup><mn>10</mn><mrow><mo>&#8722;</mo><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup></math>.</p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfenced><mrow><mn>1</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">F</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>96500</mn><mo>&#160;</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">C</mi><mo>&#160;</mo><msup><mi>mol</mi><mrow><mo>&#8722;</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msup></mrow></mfenced></math></p>"
